  {
    "title": "Connect companies and learners",
    "seconds": 35,
    "notes": "We are designing the platform around two groups. Companies can bring robots, practical problems, and mentors. In return, they can discover ideas and people with useful skills. Learners bring curiosity and teamwork, but they need a clear starting point and a way to show what they can do. HumanoidTH connects these groups through shared challenges. Universities, labs, and service providers can support the journey. These are the needs and partnerships we want to validate in our first pilot.",
